lib_anima_ref/kv.py and the FP32 LoRA delta in lib_anima_ref/adapter.py are ported from Anima Role Ref KV
(https://huggingface.co/AnticPan/Anima-Role-Ref-KV, anima_role_ref_kv/reference.py, lora.py and pipeline.py),
